    <string name="sync_undo_dialog_title">Undo last sync?</string>
    <string name="sync_undo_dialog_body">Your library goes back to how it was before the last sync: playlists it hid come back, playlists it added are hidden, and playlists it emptied are refilled in their original order%1$s.\n\nTracks you added or removed yourself, and Download switches you changed, are kept. Downloaded files that were already deleted can\'t be brought back.\n\nAuto-sync then pauses until you tap Sync, so it doesn\'t redo it.</string>
